<title>USA: Pharmaceuticals says completes divestiture.</title>
<headline>Pharmaceuticals says completes divestiture.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pharmaceutical Marketing Services Inc said Thursday it completed the divestiture of its international publishing and communications operation based in the Netherlands.</p>
<p>The company said its Dutch and US-based international publishing and communications operations, PMSI-Bugamor, was acquired by Excerpta Medica, the medical communications arm of Elsevier Science.</p>
<p>The company did not disclose terms of the deal.</p>
